{"posts":[{"id":"luska_p3_51","t":"Loonie Done","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#51","p":3,"im":["1f1d12a9c4d46693643b4a4fb4db6309dabaf17a"],"m":51},{"id":"luska_p3_52","t":"niceee:)","a":"faldot","d":"","n":"#52","p":3,"im":[],"m":52},{"id":"luska_p3_53","t":"Euro QM Sell\n\nUJ Burst from Compression","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#53","p":3,"im":["6e54f586bb9789e4ae0a8012a2ff2a4923d13149","f12c88c3c4d5d8c67e0aaa564898f1d933159b8e"],"m":53},{"id":"luska_p3_54","t":"Superb entries... congratulations - you nailed it","a":"Infest","d":"","n":"#54","p":3,"im":[],"m":54},{"id":"luska_p3_55","t":"Just 3 trades during nfp and the progress or yen Swissy\n\nEuro\n\nCable\n\nAnd progress of yen","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#55","p":3,"im":["0286fa56081b09d60caef1c4dd4e5a142b01a2f6","c630ee97d4b47b8dd852d7fc7b6ceb0255d30959","0d774fe9a9365370f4af6ffe9afb5b51b9b17a38","eda536ca273379525e384182f4b443ca57c429e9"],"m":55},{"id":"luska_p3_56","t":"some tips for such trades... i dont trade wif SL becoz i hunt where the SL are gonna be in the chart... so where u plan to put ur SL is where ure supposed to place ur entry... try it...","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#56","p":3,"im":[],"m":56},{"id":"luska_p3_57","t":"I'm a big fan of your journal. I would love to read more about your strategy towards trading, like approach and why you took the trade... it seems you just touch trade. If you don't use a SL, how do you protect your capital. After what amount of SL you saying \"this is it\" and drop the trade?\n\nHow is you progress towards equity curve going? In February I see youve struggled to keep a positive result... how is this going?","a":"Infest","d":"","n":"#57","p":3,"im":[],"m":57},{"id":"luska_p3_58","t":"yup february i was struggling like hell broke lose...thats y i go to hiding for quite sometime and meditate hehe...nah just reviewing what kinda silly mistake i took and learn from it... i noticed my SL are usually hit... i tried to find out why... everyday the market does the same sh*t...but i dont trade everyday instead i just watch...only when i see the price and time is right shall i enter..been practising these on demo and results i got are overwhelming... the method i use is not only SND... i dunno if the admin allows me to post my method here...its not a system of course...its the basic thing thats happening in the market everyday and systems u name it all comes from this method...only if Admin allows then i will post... and its all about price and time.... thats all","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#58","p":3,"im":[],"m":58},{"id":"luska_p3_59","t":"Whenever u look at the chart, u hunt for SND zone... ok you r in the right track... but have u considered that there are millions others looking at that too??? So, try to spot where they put their stop loss....thats where u enter... i hunt stop loss from snd zones","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#59","p":3,"im":[],"m":59},{"id":"luska_p3_60","t":"My live trades.... Still practicing...\n\nSome of it has sl which is damn far but i dont need it actually... my profits are exited when i tink its enuf for me or i spot reversal coming...","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#60","p":3,"im":["954552964d33786fb48498caa004d92fb944057a"],"m":60},{"id":"luska_p3_61","t":"Here we go","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#61","p":3,"im":["16a55ecf5a139c63938370b7a740710c8164effb"],"m":61},{"id":"luska_p3_62","t":"QM in M1 Timeframe...Lets see if this works","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#62","p":3,"im":["e176d06e8ea404d17eb0f39284859ac3bbbb4cbe"],"m":62},{"id":"luska_p3_63","t":"BlueK!!! failed","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#63","p":3,"im":[],"m":63},{"id":"luska_p3_64","t":"2 Interest... Swissy Daily QM sell Opportunity\n\nLoonie compression to supply","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#64","p":3,"im":["62cafd93b602daf0a0d7d355bad4a7e5ee35e19f","53a3dc3f61ec9f05804778be99a3da55456ede2e"],"m":64},{"id":"luska_p3_65","t":"WOW!!! I didnt know that i have some followers who follows my journal closely until i received private messages regarding my absence. Sorry \"fans\". Im busy fighting my emotions.Also since in a bit lazy sorting out my mess when i wrote in my journal, i make use of the facebook group as my journal... My analysis are posted in there and only can be viewed by my affiliates. And i over-leveraged my account. I have this mindset of catching a falling knife. Very dangerous right? But if you focus on the falling knife and follow the momentum as it falls and catch it at the right timing, you wont get hurt. Thats how i tink. Impposible stuffs i make it possible. Anyway this is the trade that i took just now on euro... Some other trades are not in this account.","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#65","p":3,"im":["ba8c78308ca93a238904a7c6c9f40c0bc362984f","27542e3d1a35b8d04270f4d602f29904cd250b2a"],"m":65},{"id":"luska_p3_66","t":"euro,just sell1.29750 when it reache there again... Happy profiting","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#66","p":3,"im":[],"m":66},{"id":"luska_p3_67","t":"Who caught it??? Just probabilities...Trade at ur own risk","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#67","p":3,"im":["217b369578fecf431d073d1ef724628d03e366f8"],"m":67},{"id":"luska_p3_68","t":"Stopped out positively and re-entered at M1 RBD.... Price fails to close above yesterday high...confirmation after H1 candle closes.","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#68","p":3,"im":["d337a7217732260348f0ec4e6934cb58cace9a37"],"m":68},{"id":"luska_p3_69","t":"3 trades i took today\n\neurGbp Before\n\nEurGbp triggered\n\nEuro Usd\n\nAnd Eur Aud\n\nThe trades are done on 2 different accounts","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#69","p":3,"im":["16a02a56cf37e43c4311d2b4eff1bfce8351339a","6531a5d28abe2c7d5e271b3dbc1fc44b03fcc861","caadc2c684fcd6c360f9cee4597ebabaf57a348f","fe0bbbeed53360673291c67d02aa398b2dba0556"],"m":69},{"id":"luska_p3_70","t":"UsdJpy","a":"Luska","d":"","n":"#70","p":3,"im":["f55c8309e26a0e2bc89872fd5bf07b311013f560"],"m":70},{"id":"luska_p3_71","t":"nice trade...:)","a":"faldot","d":"","n":"#71","p":3,"im":[],"m":71},{"id":"luska_p3_72","t":"Aussie\n\nCompleting the cycle... Stamped 13 june 2013","a":"Lus